app.get('/.well-known/security.txt', (req, res) => {
  const securityTxt = `Contact: security@example.com
Preferred-Languages: en
Canonical: https://example.com/.well-known/security.txt
Expires: ${new Date(Date.now() + 365 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString()}
`;
  res.type('text/plain').send(securityTxt);
});
```

---

## Compliance & Regulations

- **GDPR**: User data exposure violates Article 32 (security of processing)
- **PCI-DSS**: Missing authentication, encryption, and logging
