|----------|-------|-----|
| **CRITICAL** | No HTTPS | Deploy behind reverse proxy with SSL/TLS |
| **CRITICAL** | Public data access | Implement authentication |
| **HIGH** | No input validation | Add express-validator |
| **HIGH** | No rate limiting | Add express-rate-limit |
| **HIGH** | Missing security headers | Add helmet.js |
| **MEDIUM** | No error handling | Implement global error handler |
